# Way of the Cook (otherAreas 1): Mhaura's Rycharde and Take (no scripts). Rycharde the Chef completed and its
# Quest[4][0]DayCompleted 7992 (a GM: 7992 + 8 <= 8000, the harness's Vana'diel day), Windurst fame 125 (level 3). A level
# 30 Warrior with two Slices of Dhalmel Meat, two Beehive Chips and a Chocobo Feather. Available: the meat and the chip
# (the valid trade, in the wrong status): no trade handler; Rycharde 76 (912, 4359), options 0, 73 and 75: nothing; Take
# 68; Rycharde 76, option 74: Quest[4][0]DayCompleted 0, EndTime 790199568 (VanadielTime() 790189200 at the harness's
# wall clock + 3 x 3456), begun. Accepted: Rycharde 78 (72: 10368 / 144); Take 65; trades (walked back to Rycharde): the
# meat alone: 73; the chip alone: 73; the meat and the feather: nil; the chip and the feather: nil; two meat: nil; the
# meat, the chip and the feather: nil; the feather and the chip (a wrong item for the meat): nil; the meat and the chip:
# 80 (before EndTime), finished: completed (fame 20 Windurst, One Star Purveyor), the trade taken, 1500 gil
# (npcUtil.giveCurrency), Quest[4][1]DayCompleted 8000. Completed: no section; Unending Chase's available section answers
# Rycharde: 75 (8000 + 7 is not below 8000); the second meat and chip: no trade handler.
lists Mhaura/Rycharde/onTrigger Mhaura/Rycharde/onTrade Mhaura/Take/onTrigger Mhaura/onEventFinish/76 Mhaura/onEventFinish/80 Mhaura/onEventFinish/81
char zone=Mhaura pos=18.9,-16,88.8 job=WAR lvl=30
quest OtherAreas.RychardeTheChef completed
charvar Quest[4][0]DayCompleted 7992
fame Windurst 125
item SliceOfDhalmelMeat x2
item BeehiveChip x2
item ChocoboFeather
login
trade Rycharde SliceOfDhalmelMeat x1 BeehiveChip x1 # available: no trade handler; nothing
trigger Rycharde                        # 7992 + 8 <= 8000, fame level 3: 76 (912, 4359)
finish option=0                         # not 74: nothing
trigger Rycharde                        # 76
finish option=73                        # below 74: nothing
trigger Rycharde                        # 76
finish option=75                        # above 74: nothing
trigger Take                            # available: 68
finish
trigger Rycharde                        # 76 (912, 4359)
finish option=74                        # Quest[4][0]DayCompleted 0, EndTime 790199568, begun
trigger Rycharde                        # accepted, before EndTime: 78 (72)
finish
trigger Take                            # accepted: 65
finish
walk 18.9,-16,88.8                      # back to Rycharde (a trade does not walk)
trade Rycharde SliceOfDhalmelMeat x1    # the meat alone: 73
finish
trade Rycharde BeehiveChip x1           # the chip alone: 73
finish
trade Rycharde SliceOfDhalmelMeat x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # the meat and an extra item: nil
trade Rycharde BeehiveChip x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # the chip and an extra item: nil
trade Rycharde SliceOfDhalmelMeat x2    # two meat: nil
trade Rycharde SliceOfDhalmelMeat x1 BeehiveChip x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # an extra item: nil
trade Rycharde ChocoboFeather x1 BeehiveChip x1 # a wrong item for the meat: nil
trade Rycharde SliceOfDhalmelMeat x1 BeehiveChip x1 # before EndTime: 80
finish                                  # completed: fame 20 Windurst, the title; the trade taken; 1500 gil; DayCompleted 8000
trigger Rycharde                        # completed: Unending Chase available, 8000 + 7 < 8000 false: 75
finish
trade Rycharde SliceOfDhalmelMeat x1 BeehiveChip x1 # completed: no trade handler; nothing
